{
PresetMetadata:{author:"Terrestrial Tribulations",category:"Story",description:"Story NPC generated by tools/gen_npcs.py from design/npcs/. 1 conversations.",entityTypeId:"easy_npc:humanoid",name:"Archivist Sol",variantType:"PROFESSOR_01",version:"1.0.0"},
data:{CustomName:"{\"color\":\"#D8C27A\",\"text\":\"Archivist Sol\"}",DialogData:{DialogDataSet:[{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_2",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_1_b",Name:"..."}],Label:"t0_1",Name:"Seven Pieces 1",Texts:[{Text:"Ah. The Shard-Born. Do sit; this will take a while, and I've been waiting forty years to say it to someone."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_3",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_2_b0",Name:"Where are they?"},{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_4",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_2_b1",Name:"Why can I open the portals now?"}],Label:"t0_2",Name:"Seven Pieces 2",Texts:[{Text:"When Queen Ysolde broke the Crown, the pieces didn't simply fall. They fled, into the realms that the Convergence held together. Each realm closed around its Shard like a fist."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_5",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_3_b",Name:"..."}],Label:"t0_3",Name:"Seven Pieces 3",Texts:[{Text:"A twilit forest under endless dusk. Islands above the clouds. A garden beneath the roots of the world. And somewhere the echo of a sound lives on, the Otherside."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_5",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_4_b",Name:"..."}],Label:"t0_4",Name:"Seven Pieces 4",Texts:[{Text:"Because you carry one already. Shard calls to Shard. The doors remember the Crown."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"default",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"t0_5_b",Name:"Back"}],Label:"t0_5",Name:"Seven Pieces 5",Texts:[{Text:"Each realm has a keeper, and none of them will hand it over politely. Shall I tell you which to start with? I have opinions."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"default",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"chat_b",Name:"Back"}],Label:"chat",Name:"Chat",Texts:[{Text:"The dusk-forest's keepers are a chain: serpent, lich, hydra, and something weeping in a tower. Each guards the next. Tamsin's people know the way in."},{Text:"Above the clouds the Valkyries hold trials. They respect courage, and they enjoy watching people fall."},{Text:"Below the roots there's a vault, and a guardian that has forgotten everything except the vault."},{Text:"Whatever you do down there, do it quietly. Something listens. It hears heartbeats."},{Text:"Footnote seven is the important one."},{Text:"Please don't bleed on the scrolls."},{Text:"Ysolde wrote in the margins. She had terrible handwriting."}]},
{Buttons:[{Actions:[{Cmd:"t0_1",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"h0_0",Name:"Ch7 · Seven Pieces"},{Actions:[{Cmd:"chat",Type:"OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG"}],Label:"h0_chat",Name:"Chat"},{Actions:[{Type:"CLOSE_DIALOG"}],Label:"h0_close",Name:"Goodbye"}],Label:"default",Name:"Archivist Sol",Texts:[{Text:"The dusk-forest's keepers are a chain: serpent, lich, hydra, and something weeping in a tower. Each guards the next. Tamsin's people know the way in."},{Text:"Above the clouds the Valkyries hold trials. They respect courage, and they enjoy watching people fall."},{Text:"Below the roots there's a vault, and a guardian that has forgotten everything except the vault."}]}],Type:"STANDARD"},EasyNPCVersion:3,Invulnerable:1b,ObjectiveData:{ObjectiveDataSet:[{Type:"LOOK_AT_PLAYER"},{Type:"LOOK_AT_RESET"}]},PersistenceRequired:1b,VariantType:"PROFESSOR_01",id:"easy_npc:humanoid"}
}
